CST-DUST: Normpfad und kohaerenter Quotient v0.1
X6 Astrolabium, 7 November 2026.

This package contains a new mathematical audit of auxiliary norm paths and
coherent finite amplitudes. Six inherited project sources are unchanged from
thomasmgfeller/x6-spectral-astrolabium at commit
573084d007ae96d82eb6c241df6ae1d572523418.
Their paths and SHA-256 digests are recorded in inputs/provenance.json.
The Apache-2.0 project license is included unchanged.

Literature is cited for background and scope only. No third-party paper is
included. Physical state selection, quantum-measure extension and singularity
resolution are not established.

